  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>daclatasvir</td></tr><tr><td>ATC code:</td><td>J05AP07</td></tr><tr><td>model:</td><td>one compartment, oral dosing <small>(PK_1C_enteral)</small></td></tr><tr><td>source:</td><td>Osawa M et al. 2018</td></tr><tr><td>population:</td><td>Japanese adults with chronic HCV genotype 1 infection</td></tr><tr><td>measured compound:</td><td>daclatasvir</td></tr><tr><td>review:</td><td>curated candidate</td></tr><tr><td>record page:</td><td><a href=\"https://pharmacolibrary.github.io/#/drugs/drug_daclatasvir/Daclatasvir_Osawa2018_reference\">pharmacolibrary-docs</a></td></tr></table><h4>Parameters as reported in the paper</h4><table border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=2><tr><th>parameter</th><th>value</th><th>unit</th><th>meaning</th></tr><tr><td>CL/F (L/h)</td><td>5.29</td><td>L/h</td><td><small>CL/F</small></td></tr><tr><td>V/F (L)</td><td>64.2</td><td>L</td><td><small>V/F</small></td></tr><tr><td>Ka (h‐1)</td><td>0.865</td><td>1/h</td><td><small>kabs</small></td></tr></table><h4>About daclatasvir</h4><p>Daclatasvir is an antiviral drug used to treat chronic hepatitis C, including in patients with liver cirrhosis. It was authorised in the European Union but that authorisation has expired, so it is no longer marketed there, though it has been included in the WHO essential medicines list.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q5207712\">Wikidata Q5207712</a> and the WHO ATC classification and the EMA medicines list; not checked by a person.</small></p><p>Identity, molar mass and metabolites: <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.Substances.Daclatasvir\">Daclatasvir</a>.</p><h4>References</h4><ol><li><p>Osawa M et al. (2018). Population Pharmacokinetic Analysis for Daclatasvir and Asunaprevir in Japanese Subjects With Chronic Hepatitis C Virus Infection. <i>Journal of clinical pharmacology 58(11):1468–1478</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1002/jcph.1274\">10.1002/jcph.1274</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/30063254\">30063254</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Osawa_2018: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"),
